#: data/io.github.runexe.RunExe.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Our built-in dependency installation system grants automatic software "
"compatibility access. Use the download manager to download the official "
"components: the runner (Wine, Proton), DXVK, dependencies, etc."
msgstr ""
"O noso sistema de instalacíon de dependencias incorporado permite o acceso "
"doado a un amplo nivel de compatibilidade de software. Tam'en incluimos un "
"xestor de descargas para descargar os compoñentes oficiais: execución "
"(Wine, Proton), DXVK, dependencias, etc."

#: data/io.github.runexe.RunExe.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Capsule versioning keeps your work safe now and lets you restore it later!"
msgstr ""
"O versionado de Botellas mantén o seu traballo a salvo agora e permítelle "
"restauralo máis tarde!"

